Dialogue: 99,0:00:38.71,0:00:39.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aia este?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:40.92,0:00:42.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aia este Planeta Sfântă?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:35.72,0:03:37.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu sunt Kahm.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.51,0:03:39.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tu cine ești?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:40.35,0:03:41.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,K-Kahm?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:43.27,0:03:44.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poți vorbi limba noastră?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:45.18,0:03:46.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ne-am sărutat mai \Ndevreme, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:47.44,0:03:50.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci acum poți \Nînțelege limba noastră.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:18.59,0:04:21.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se pare că te-ai trezit, \Ndragul nostru oaspete.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:22.14,0:04:23.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oaspete?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:25.02,0:04:25.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu se poate!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:28.85,0:04:29.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt în spațiu!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:30.02,0:04:31.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa este!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:36.82,0:04:39.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Înțeleg. Deci am fost \Nrăpit de acea fată.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:40.11,0:04:44.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Răpit? Asta e absurd!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:44.95,0:04:49.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se pare că prințesa \Na prins drag de tine!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:49.50,0:04:50.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prințesa?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:50.92,0:04:52.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:52.17,0:04:55.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prințesa Kahm a Imperiului \NSfântului Evascuraze.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:56.38,0:04:59.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sfântul Evascuraze?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:59.51,0:05:00.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prințesa Kahm?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:06.97,0:05:08.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mă atingeți!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:08.85,0:05:12.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba! Nu-mi pasă dacă e \Nprințesă sau orice altceva...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:12.44,0:05:15.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce aveți de gând \Nsă faceți cu mine?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:20.57,0:05:24.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bun. Am pregătit o cină specială \Npentru dragul nostru oaspete.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:25.70,0:05:27.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aceasta este soția mea, Momo.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:27.54,0:05:30.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nimeni nu se pricepe mai \Nbine decât soția mea
Dialogue: 99,0:05:30.33,0:05:33.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,în prepararea unei mese care \Nsă-ți mărească virilitatea.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:34.58,0:05:35.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-i așa, Momo?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:37.67,0:05:39.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, încetează, dragule!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:41.17,0:05:42.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haide, mănâncă tot!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:46.14,0:05:48.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,V-Vreți să mănânc {\i1}asta{\i0}?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:49.93,0:05:53.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,V-am spus că voi veți mânca mai târziu, copii neastâpărați!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:55.40,0:05:59.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, eu trebuie să merg și s-o ajut pe prințesă cu ținuta ei.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:00.03,0:06:01.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Va fi prima ei \Nnoapte matrimonială,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:01.36,0:06:05.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,deci trebuie să învăț obiceiurile \Ncelor din Imperiul Sfântul Evascuraze.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:06.07,0:06:07.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,P-Prima noapte matrimonială?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:08.03,0:06:09.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Urmează să se căsătorească?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:15.71,0:06:18.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, ești așa de amuzant!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:18.21,0:06:21.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirele se preface că nu știe!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:21.72,0:06:23.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E-Eu sunt mirele?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:37.86,0:06:42.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și este destul de înzestrat \Nacolo jos, Prințesă.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:42.61,0:06:45.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acum, câteva lucruri \Nimportante de reținut...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:46.87,0:06:50.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O soție nu trebuie să-și facă niciodată de râs soțul!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:50.49,0:06:52.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și trebuie să-i fie \Nmereu alături, orice ar fi!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:53.58,0:06:55.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să-i fiu mereu alături, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:55.83,0:06:58.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Există o tehnică \Nspecială pentru asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:58.84,0:07:00.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sau, cel puțin, \Nasta mi-a spus Battia.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:00.42,0:07:04.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și trebuie să-i ofere \Npace și liniște soțului ei!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:05.59,0:07:06.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Înțeleg, înțeleg.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:08.14,0:07:09.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:09.30,0:07:12.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta vrem noi să-i facem \Nsă creadă, Prințesă.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:14.98,0:07:18.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ca femei, trebuie să \Nne jucăm rolul bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:18.61,0:07:22.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bărbații sunt ușor de \Npăcălit cu un simplu zâmbet.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:22.32,0:07:25.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unde-i punem, acolo vor sta.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:25.32,0:07:29.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vor mânca toată \Nmâncarea pe care le-o dăm.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:29.74,0:07:31.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și vor vrea să facem \Ncopii în continuu.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:32.45,0:07:36.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bărbații sunt niște \Ncreaturi jalnice.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:39.04,0:07:42.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sună așa de complicat.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:42.46,0:07:45.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apropo, asta va prima \Nvoastră noapte împreună.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:45.92,0:07:50.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trebuie să recunosc că \Nsunt puțin îngrijorată.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:54.35,0:07:55.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:55.27,0:07:58.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu v-am spus să ciocăniți la ușă \Nînainte să intrați în camerele prințesei?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:59.98,0:08:01.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poftim?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:02.19,0:08:03.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Ce s-a întâmplat?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:14.79,0:08:16.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vrei să te trimitem \Nînapoi pe Pământ?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:17.04,0:08:19.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești prost cumva?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:19.96,0:08:23.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Cum îndrăznești să mă \Nfaci prost, invadatoareo!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:24.55,0:08:26.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-Invadatoare?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:27.22,0:08:28.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exagerezi un pic!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:29.13,0:08:32.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În primul rând, voi sunteți invadatorii \Ncare au pus stăpânire pe Planeta Sfântă!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:33.10,0:08:34.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poftim?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:36.85,0:08:39.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-mi pasă. Trimite-mă \Nînapoi pe Pământ!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:39.27,0:08:40.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Altfel...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:40.69,0:08:42.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Altfel ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:43.86,0:08:45.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu te apropia de mine!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:45.82,0:08:47.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și trimite-mă înapoi pe Pământ!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:50.36,0:08:51.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dragul meu soț!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:53.70,0:08:56.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești așa de prost!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:59.21,0:09:00.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Auci!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:02.88,0:09:05.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, mă bucur așa \Nde tare că ești bine!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:11.93,0:09:15.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba. Nu știu ce fel de \Ntruc a mai fost și ăsta, dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:26.98,0:09:27.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:28.23,0:09:29.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fie.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:30.49,0:09:32.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă nu mă placi...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:33.36,0:09:34.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta este.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:34.16,0:09:37.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai, ei bine, nu am spus asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:38.50,0:09:40.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prințesă...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:41.75,0:09:45.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,TLC,To think that you're doing this
Dialogue: 99,0:09:45.25,0:09:47.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,TLC,because you want to save
Dialogue: 99,0:09:47.38,0:09:48.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,TLC,the people of the holy planet.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:48.92,0:09:51.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Planeta Sfântă?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:51.42,0:09:54.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te referi la planeta Pământ?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:54.80,0:09:55.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exact.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:55.93,0:10:00.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se pare că împăratul vrea să curețe acea planetă de oameni.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:00.52,0:10:04.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar dacă prințesa se \Nva căsători cu tine,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:04.10,0:10:08.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,acesta va fi nevoit \Nsă se răzgândească.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:08.73,0:10:09.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Înțelegi?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:20.45,0:10:21.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E vina ta!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:21.70,0:10:22.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa este.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:27.96,0:10:28.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:35.84,0:10:37.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Battia!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:39.10,0:10:40.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Când ai ajuns aici?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:40.47,0:10:42.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ne-am văzut de mult.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:42.14,0:10:44.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mă lua cu asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:44.81,0:10:48.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te-am căutat peste tot.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:48.36,0:10:51.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă gândeam eu că te-ai \Nîndrăgostit de vreun pămpălău.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:52.90,0:10:55.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tu vorbești?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:58.20,0:11:00.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aceea este Battia, \Nprietena ei cea mai bună.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:01.16,0:11:04.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar, Kahm, nu prea știu ce să \Nzic despre această maimuță.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:06.71,0:11:07.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maimuță?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:08.00,0:11:09.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Crezi că împăratul \Nva fi de acord cu el?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:10.92,0:11:13.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu prea înțelege deloc \Nceea ce vrei să faci.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:13.80,0:11:16.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ba chiar mi-a cerut să te caut.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:17.22,0:11:20.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-ai vreme de pierdut cu \Nmaimuțe proaste ca el.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:20.39,0:11:23.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce atâta grabă? Vreau să \Nfac lucrurile în ritmul meu.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:23.52,0:11:25.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oricum, nu m-am mai \Nvăzut cu tata de trei luni.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:26.06,0:11:28.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce fel de relație părinte-copil \Nexistă între ei doi?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:30.52,0:11:31.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Crezi că poți fugi de împărat?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:32.11,0:11:34.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tu ești singura lui fiică!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:34.40,0:11:38.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cel cu care te căsătorești va da \Nmoștenitorul Imperiului Sfântul Evascuraze.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:40.62,0:11:42.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trebuie doar să \Nmă căsătoresc, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:44.37,0:11:46.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-mi spune că \Nvrei s-o faci cu el.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:47.87,0:11:49.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E un mare pămpălău!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:49.75,0:11:51.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E scund și încet la minte.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:51.88,0:11:53.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mai arată și ca \Nun adevărat pervers.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:53.71,0:11:56.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce vezi la acea maimuță?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:56.84,0:11:59.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mai lasă-mă în pace!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:59.34,0:12:01.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cel ales de tata e \Nun mare dobitoc!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:01.80,0:12:03.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vezi tu...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:03.10,0:12:05.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu vreau să-mi petrec \Nviața cu un tip ca el!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:05.89,0:12:09.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,TLC,Having someone else pick\Nwho I'm going to marry...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:09.69,0:12:10.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,TLC,I hate that!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:11.44,0:12:12.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,K-Kahm...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:19.78,0:12:24.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Un cavaler ca mine... \Nnu se va lăsa păcălit așa de ușor.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:29.08,0:12:30.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Datoria unei soții este...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:30.96,0:12:32.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am uitat... Îmi mai \Npoți spune o dată, Momo?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:32.92,0:12:33.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, da.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:33.88,0:12:36.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O soție trebuie să-i fie \Nmereu alături soțului ei.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:36.38,0:12:38.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, asta. Îi voi fi \Nalături soțului meu.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:39.22,0:12:40.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și nu vei putea să mă oprești.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:43.55,0:12:44.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doamne...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:44.72,0:12:47.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce nu-ți poți găsi \Nun bărbat adevărat?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:47.85,0:12:51.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mai lasă-mă! Ce știi \Ntu despre bărbați?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:53.15,0:12:54.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vorbește virgina.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:54.77,0:12:57.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și tu te comporți ca o virgină!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:02.49,0:13:03.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:03.57,0:13:06.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu vă luptați între voi!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:26.68,0:13:28.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, vai!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:28.73,0:13:29.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mai bagă în tine!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:33.90,0:13:37.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kahm se luptă pentru mine?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:38.15,0:13:39.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pe bune?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:10.60,0:14:14.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nătângule. Chiar credeai \Ncă aș răni-o pe Kahm?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:15.86,0:14:19.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,TLC,We were just up to our old tricks.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:19.53,0:14:20.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, serios?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:23.24,0:14:27.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kahm, bănuiesc că te-ai îndrăgostit \Nde el la prima vedere, ca o virgină.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:27.83,0:14:30.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar ești liberă să faci ce dorești.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:30.62,0:14:33.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce-ați zice să sărbătorim \Ncu ceva de băut?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:34.04,0:14:34.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:34.92,0:14:37.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt sigură că asta îl va scoate din pepeni pe împărat!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:37.92,0:14:39.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Probabil va fi \Nnegru de supărare.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:39.96,0:14:43.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu va mai putea face nimic \Ndacă ne-am culcat deja.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:46.72,0:14:49.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vom vedea dacă va fi așa.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:51.06,0:14:53.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,TLC,We'll cross that bridge when we come to it.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:53.89,0:14:55.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, stai o secundă, Kahm...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:55.44,0:14:57.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poate ar trebui să te mai \Ngândești puțin la asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:57.69,0:15:01.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar crezi că un pământean \Nși un evascurazean o pot face?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:01.73,0:15:02.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Știi, mă refer la...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:12.41,0:15:13.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu cred că va \Nfi vreo problemă!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:15.54,0:15:16.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prostule!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:21.50,0:15:23.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Ce e asta? \NCe naiba se aude?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:23.55,0:15:26.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-ți face griji. E doar \No avertizare de proximitate.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:26.38,0:15:28.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Înseamnă că se \Napropie cineva de noi.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:32.43,0:15:34.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cred că ar trebui \Nsă-ți faci griji, Kahm.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:34.89,0:15:38.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bătrânul tău drag e pe \Ncale să-și facă apariția.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:38.40,0:15:39.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:46.86,0:15:48.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta e nasol!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:48.91,0:15:50.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E bătrânul Progres.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:53.45,0:15:55.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Împăratul a ajuns la \Napogeul puterii sale,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:55.87,0:15:57.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,dar nu are niciun moștenitor.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:57.50,0:16:00.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În plus, își face continuu griji \Npentru fiica sa neastâmpărată.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:01.09,0:16:03.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă o voi putea \Naduce înapoi pe Kahm,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.59,0:16:06.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,statutul meu în imperiu \Nse va îmbunătății.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:10.60,0:16:13.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Ce înseaamnă asta, Prințesă?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:13.81,0:16:16.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mai întâi, vă strecurați \Nprintre navele flotei mele,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:16.10,0:16:18.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,iar apoi aterizați \Npe Planeta Sfântă.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:18.10,0:16:19.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În plus, această creatură...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:20.06,0:16:21.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E o maimuță, \Ndupă cum poți vedea...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:21.98,0:16:23.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Comandant al Flotei, \Ndomnule Progres.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:23.73,0:16:24.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-mi mai spune așa.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:26.36,0:16:29.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar voi lua asupra mea \Nîntreaga furie a împăratului,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:29.82,0:16:30.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prințesă.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:31.24,0:16:34.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mare păcat, dar bănuiesc \Ncă asta e treaba ta.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:34.99,0:16:36.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:36.79,0:16:39.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pare că ai un plan \Nsecret pus la cale.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:47.51,0:16:50.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, avem toate datele \Npe care le-ai adunat,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:50.76,0:16:53.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,deci ne vom întoarce \Nimediat în imperiu.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:24.00,0:17:26.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hopa! Îmi cer scuze pentru asta!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:26.42,0:17:29.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am apăsat puțin prea tare pedala de \Naccelerație și am pierdut controlul navei.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:30.17,0:17:31.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Geobaldi?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:32.22,0:17:35.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ai fost în stare să-ți \Ncontrolezi nava, Geobaldi?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:35.14,0:17:38.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cum naiba a ajuns \Ncomandant cineva ca tine?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:38.39,0:17:40.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, nava mea nu e ca a ta,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:40.52,0:17:44.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,făcută doar să patruleze \Nîn jurul împăratului.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:44.65,0:17:48.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A mea e mult mai energică \Nși plină de personalitate.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:49.11,0:17:51.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce naiba tot spui acolo?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:51.20,0:17:55.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești doar un parvenit care nu e în \Nstare nici măcar să-și conducă nava!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:56.45,0:17:59.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai grijă ce spui, \Ndomnule Progres.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:00.25,0:18:03.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nici măcar împăratul nu e \Nîn stare să vadă până aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:03.46,0:18:06.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you were seen dead, floating in space,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:06.42,0:18:08.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,he'd never know who did it.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:11.01,0:18:12.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Privește.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:12.13,0:18:14.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All the beautiful women,\NPrincess Kahm included,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:15.01,0:18:17.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are Geobaldi's allies.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:18.06,0:18:19.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prostule.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:20.22,0:18:23.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Destul, Geobaldi.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:23.60,0:18:25.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dă-te jos de pe noi!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:26.48,0:18:30.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doar când te vei sui \Ntu pe mine, Battia.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:31.94,0:18:32.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cheeky.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:44.37,0:18:47.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce se va întâmpla \Ncu mine acum?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:53.34,0:18:56.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, ai terminat deja?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:57.76,0:18:59.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt frânt.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:59.43,0:19:01.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doamne...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:01.06,0:19:04.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were going on about how\Nready you were a minute ago.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:05.56,0:19:06.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:14.24,0:19:17.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When was the first time we did it?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:17.95,0:19:19.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:19.16,0:19:21.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Getting emotional about\Nthis doesn't suit you.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:21.29,0:19:24.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been about six months\Nsince we last slept together.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:24.83,0:19:26.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:27.38,0:19:28.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just that...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:29.13,0:19:35.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never really felt what\NKahm is feeling now.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:35.34,0:19:36.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:38.14,0:19:39.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:39.35,0:19:40.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't this all your fault?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:40.68,0:19:42.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Battia...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:42.56,0:19:46.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I forgot to tell you,\NProgress is under the bed.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:46.98,0:19:47.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:57.11,0:19:58.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:58.91,0:20:01.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got lots of time
Dialogue: 99,0:20:01.58,0:20:05.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,until we get to\NSaint Evascuraze, Geobaldi.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:05.75,0:20:07.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey... Battia!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:13.80,0:20:17.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, let me leave you two together.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:21.22,0:20:23.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave them alone!\NLeave them alone!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:30.86,0:20:34.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, what's on your mind right now?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:34.53,0:20:36.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:37.19,0:20:39.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't exactly say that there's nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:42.24,0:20:46.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I think about how the fate\Nof Earth rests on my shoulders...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:50.54,0:20:53.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No! That doesn't mean\NI'm not interested in you.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:54.34,0:20:55.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just that...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:16.44,0:21:19.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you hurt me,\NI'll hate you forever.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:44.01,0:21:45.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:45.10,0:21:46.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that how they do it?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:48.77,0:21:50.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave them alone!\NLeave them alone!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:05.95,0:22:07.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way!\NThe warp's over?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:07.99,0:22:10.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the...\NBut I haven't done anything!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:49.64,0:23:51.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on. Introduce yourself
Dialogue: 99,0:23:51.85,0:23:54.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,U-Uh, um, Your Majesty..
Dialogue: 99,0:23:55.10,0:23:58.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Tetsuya Wakatsuki
Dialogue: 99,0:23:58.27,0:23:59.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,19 years old.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:59.40,0:24:01.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a photographer.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:01.57,0:24:02.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still a virgin.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:03.28,0:24:04.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, Dad!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:04.90,0:24:07.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't attack the people\Nwho live on the holy planet!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:13.37,0:24:14.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsuya's...
Dialogue: 99,0:24:16.29,0:24:18.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsuya's my fiancé!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:22.80,0:24:25.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So please don't go after Tetsuya's planet.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:42.23,0:24:45.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Who are you guys?\NLet go! Let me go!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:45.94,0:24:47.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,L-Let go!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:47.99,0:24:49.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Execute him!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:50.78,0:24:51.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Execute?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:51.91,0:24:54.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,L-Let go, you asshole!\NHey, wait!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:54.70,0:24:55.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:55.91,0:24:57.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two!\NLet go of him!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:58.16,0:24:59.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm ordering you!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:59.96,0:25:00.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:04.96,0:25:06.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:07.42,0:25:09.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kahm! This isn't what\Nyou said would happen!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:09.51,0:25:11.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How dare you lie to me!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:11.34,0:25:14.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shit! Just once!\NLet me have her once before I die!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:15.51,0:25:17.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die a virgin!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:18.85,0:25:22.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are the crown princess\Nof Saint Evascuraze.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:22.69,0:25:24.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't do it!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:26.90,0:25:30.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to do as you\Nsay forever, you know!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:31.36,0:25:32.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're being selfish!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:33.37,0:25:34.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's being selfish?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:35.16,0:25:37.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want everything to go your way.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:37.66,0:25:39.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd say you're a lot more selfish!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:40.75,0:25:43.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!\NI will choose whom you marry!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:43.63,0:25:46.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! No! No! No!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:46.67,0:25:49.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to choose myself!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:49.59,0:25:51.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nobody's going to tell me what to do!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:52.38,0:25:53.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:53.59,0:25:55.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apologize to His Majesty.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:56.31,0:25:57.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:57.51,0:26:00.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're just having a bad nightmare.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:00.23,0:26:04.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you're just imagining getting\Nmarried to that lowly creature.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:04.81,0:26:05.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look...
Dialogue: 99,0:26:06.52,0:26:10.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know everything about\Nwhat you're plotting.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:10.74,0:26:12.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't want me to tell Dad...
Dialogue: 99,0:26:13.53,0:26:14.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...get out of the way!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:17.74,0:26:18.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:39.43,0:26:41.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tet... su... ya...
Dialogue: 99,0:27:10.25,0:27:11.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get up here!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:14.72,0:27:15.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 99,0:27:15.80,0:27:16.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, hurry!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:18.51,0:27:19.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:22.85,0:27:24.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:37.24,0:27:39.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:39.78,0:27:40.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:44.83,0:27:45.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:55.84,0:27:58.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsuya, you're still alive!
Dialogue: 99,0:28:06.52,0:28:07.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:08.02,0:28:09.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a little dizzy.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:09.77,0:28:11.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you some kind of pervert?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:13.11,0:28:14.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm just a normal guy!
Dialogue: 99,0:28:20.28,0:28:22.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsuya! Thank you!
Dialogue: 99,0:28:29.21,0:28:32.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to have to teach my dad a lesson!
Dialogue: 99,0:28:52.90,0:28:53.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:55.03,0:28:55.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:57.49,0:28:58.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's elope.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:00.11,0:29:01.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elope?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:03.03,0:29:07.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So we can consummate our forbidden love!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:09.37,0:29:12.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's enough fun and games.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:12.75,0:29:14.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up.\NCome on.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:14.92,0:29:16.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're in trouble.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:16.67,0:29:21.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you,\Nnow I'm a wanted man.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:23.14,0:29:23.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:23.93,0:29:25.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want to join us?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:25.85,0:29:29.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're with us, the empire\Ncan't get at you so easily.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:29.77,0:29:31.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That sounds fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:32.77,0:29:35.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But all for this lowlife!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:39.57,0:29:40.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your Highness,
Dialogue: 99,0:29:40.90,0:29:42.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what's happened to you?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:42.45,0:29:44.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enough of your weird interests.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:44.95,0:29:45.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:46.95,0:29:50.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I might just be a lowly creature!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:54.08,0:29:57.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I'm not going to let you insult Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:00.59,0:30:03.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, this is interesting.\NCome at me!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:18.90,0:30:20.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want to try again?
Dialogue: 99,0:30:20.40,0:30:23.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is man to man!\NDie!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:26.41,0:30:29.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not much, considering your big mouth.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:30.91,0:30:31.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsuya!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:31.91,0:30:33.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay back, Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:33.29,0:30:34.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Women should stay out of this!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:34.96,0:30:37.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a duel, man to man!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:39.50,0:30:40.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsuya...
Dialogue: 99,0:30:41.05,0:30:43.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you still going to shoot off your mouth?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:48.24,0:31:49.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Accept your defeat.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:54.62,0:31:55.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:57.37,0:31:59.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you really want to die?
Dialogue: 99,0:32:00.04,0:32:01.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:42.13,0:32:44.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsuya!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:45.80,0:32:47.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's still breathing.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:48.22,0:32:49.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Use that special power, Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:51.05,0:32:53.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never tried this\Nresuscitation technique before,
Dialogue: 99,0:32:53.14,0:32:56.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but only those of royal blood can do it.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:03.15,0:33:06.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Emergency alert!\NThe alien has escaped!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:06.82,0:33:09.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He appears to have\Nkidnapped Princess Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:09.78,0:33:13.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All palace forces are on emergency status!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:28.80,0:33:30.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll hold back the troops.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:41.31,0:33:44.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's have some fun while we stall them.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:44.31,0:33:45.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go crazy.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:12.68,0:34:14.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you die.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:21.73,0:34:23.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you die!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:43.29,0:34:44.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow...
Dialogue: 99,0:34:50.55,0:34:52.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My injuries!\NMy injuries are gone!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:08.73,0:35:10.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kahm.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:17.37,0:35:18.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Kahm?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:20.95,0:35:22.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm just tired.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:25.12,0:35:27.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'm not drunk!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:29.63,0:35:32.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just hang on to me tight, and you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:35.30,0:35:38.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, I didn't tell you to grab me there!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:41.22,0:35:42.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn!\NThey're after us!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:49.73,0:35:50.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:51.48,0:35:53.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come here, Your Highness!\NI'll save you!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:54.82,0:35:55.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:07.92,0:36:09.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The dock is just past this.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:11.38,0:36:12.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piece of cake.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:28.65,0:36:29.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:30.23,0:36:31.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You all right?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:31.44,0:36:32.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:39.45,0:36:39.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 99,0:36:42.70,0:36:43.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Activate engines!
Dialogue: 99,0:36:52.59,0:36:54.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:13.44,0:37:14.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What shall we do?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:22.95,0:37:23.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your orders!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:28.37,0:37:30.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Battia and Geobaldi!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:31.25,0:37:32.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No need to thank us.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:32.88,0:37:34.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here comes your favorite guy.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:41.05,0:37:43.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!\NIs that Progress?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:44.18,0:37:45.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I bet he's mad as hell
Dialogue: 99,0:37:46.47,0:37:47.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready to attack!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:48.43,0:37:50.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The target is very close to us.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:50.52,0:37:52.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we fire with too much power,
Dialogue: 99,0:37:52.31,0:37:54.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Princess Kahm's vessel will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:55.69,0:37:57.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.\NAim for the engines.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:57.40,0:37:59.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make it so she can't move.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:59.44,0:38:00.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:07.37,0:38:08.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about our counterattack?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:08.91,0:38:10.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Too early.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:17.00,0:38:18.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To all vessels:
Dialogue: 99,0:38:19.13,0:38:22.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Surround both Kahm\Nand Geobaldi's vessels!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:32.31,0:38:33.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yikes.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:33.39,0:38:34.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't we just warp out of here?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:35.23,0:38:35.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:35.94,0:38:37.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're still in planetary gravitational space.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:37.82,0:38:39.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We haven't even done the repairs\Nto the damaged spots yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:40.11,0:38:41.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'd be lucky if we could power up!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:41.61,0:38:42.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:43.07,0:38:44.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take it easy!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:44.91,0:38:46.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are we set to go?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:46.41,0:38:48.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all ready to go.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:49.45,0:38:50.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:52.66,0:38:54.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about that?\NYou can't move.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:01.97,0:39:02.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a fleet!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:07.51,0:39:09.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!\NTurn around!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:10.64,0:39:13.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Head straight for Progress' ship!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:23.90,0:39:26.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The fool.\NWhat's Geobaldi doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:26.41,0:39:27.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's leaving himself open.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:28.12,0:39:30.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Full power to the main gun!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:31.16,0:39:32.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's totally reckless!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:38.17,0:39:40.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?\NAre you crazy?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:42.55,0:39:43.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:43.84,0:39:44.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, lowlife...
Dialogue: 99,0:39:46.09,0:39:47.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take care of the princess.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:48.05,0:39:48.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Geobaldi.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:51.18,0:39:52.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Target in sight!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:53.14,0:39:55.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the end of Geobaldi.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:16.25,0:40:17.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:22.75,0:40:23.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:25.26,0:40:27.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The ship is shedding its armor!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:27.68,0:40:28.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:45.07,0:40:46.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 99,0:40:51.45,0:40:54.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The entire fleet is shedding its skin!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:57.50,0:40:58.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:59.58,0:41:01.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We did it, Captain!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:02.29,0:41:02.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:03.09,0:41:05.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did Geobaldi do this?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:15.56,0:41:16.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sights are okay!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:17.39,0:41:18.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:49.76,0:41:53.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose all of that was pointless.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:54.01,0:41:57.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The princess' ship is escaping\Nwith Geobaldi's ship.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:57.97,0:42:01.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you not going to pursue\Nthem and get the princess back?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:01.52,0:42:02.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your orders?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:02.44,0:42:03.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just leave them.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:57.91,0:42:59.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave them alone!\NLeave them alone!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:02.83,0:43:03.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave them alone!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:07.17,0:43:07.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gently.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:07.92,0:43:10.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like we'll be able to save Earth.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:16.72,0:43:20.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A man, so what?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:22.77,0:43:25.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you seem pissed off today.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:25.23,0:43:27.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and drink this!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:29.07,0:43:30.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ți-ai cam ieșit din mână.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:30.69,0:43:32.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mi-am ieșit din mână? \NȘi ai vreo problemă cu asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:34.28,0:43:36.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E destul de sexy.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:48.79,0:43:50.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Săruturile sunt \Nașa de dulci.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:51.71,0:43:52.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu crezi?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:52.84,0:43:53.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ia-mă ușor!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:54.63,0:43:56.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să nu-i deranjăm! \NSă nu-i deranjăm!
Dialogue: 99,0:47:49.37,0:47:51.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să nu-i deranjăm! \NSă nu-i deranjăm!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.38,0:04:04.89,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(0,0)\c&H0F0C0E&\blur1\p1}m 0 0 l 1440 0 1440 1080 0 1080
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.38,0:04:04.89,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,530)\fscx300\fscy300\fnRobot Rebels\fsp5\b1\c&H1F42DF&\alpha&HFF&\blur2\t(0,1500,\alpha&H00&)}VIZITATORI \N{\fscx250\fscy250\c&HE5F7E5&\alpha&HFF&\blur1.6\t(3000,4500,\alpha&H00&)}DIN SPAȚIU
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.73,0:44:12.82,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Nemuru yoru no sora ni\NIn the sleepy night sky
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.40,0:44:20.58,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Hoshi ga egaku HOROSCOPE wa\NThe horoscope of stars
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.95,0:44:32.34,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Futari no ai o musubu aoi densetsu\NReveals a blue legend of lovers joining together
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.73,0:44:56.99,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Aa an at a to mitsumeatta toki kara\NAh, when I first laid eyes on you
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.82,0:45:02.03,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Mienai ito kanjita\NI felt something special
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.58,0:45:09.79,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Aa watashi no kokoro hikiyoseru no wa\NAh, the one who draws my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.71,0:45:14.88,Song TL,,0,0,0,,DÉJÀ VU no hohoemi\NThe déjà vu of your smile
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.71,0:45:19.55,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Hold me daite\NPlease hold me
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.05,0:45:23.01,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Kiss you amaku\NKiss you sweetly
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.18,0:45:26.06,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Love me towa ni\NLove me forever
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.18,0:45:32.48,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Tonight, tonight, tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.48,0:45:35.36,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Starry eyes, holy eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.90,0:45:45.33,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Hitomi no naka ni aoi hoshi o atsumenagara\NAs we stare, we gaze at the blue planet
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.41,0:45:48.33,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Starry eyes, holy eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.70,0:45:51.54,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Kienai hikari\NAn unseen light
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.79,0:45:57.42,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Ai o ai o shinjiatta\NWe believe in the love
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.59,0:46:04.60,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Oh, starry eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.79,0:46:39.76,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Aa kore kara donna toki ga kuru no ka\NAh, whatever we may face in the future
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.63,0:46:44.76,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Dare mo shiranai keredo\NNo one knows
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.47,0:46:52.56,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Aa sore demo to oi sora no mukou ni\NAh, but still I'm sure there is something
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.39,0:46:58.07,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Nanika ga aru hazu\NFar in the distant sky
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.65,0:47:02.40,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Hold me daite\NPlease hold me
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.65,0:47:05.95,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Kiss you amaku\NKiss you sweetly
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.03,0:47:08.58,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Love me towa ni\NLove me forever
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.83,0:47:15.33,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Tonight, tonight, tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.33,0:47:18.29,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Starry eyes, holy eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.38,0:47:21.67,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Hitomi no naka de\NAs we stare
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.80,0:47:27.97,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Negai kanau you ni ryuusei\NWe hope our wishes will come true
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.39,0:47:31.35,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Starry eyes, holy eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.43,0:47:34.56,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Yokogiru sora ni\NCrossing the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.64,0:47:40.32,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Ai o ai o chikaiatta\NWe declare our love for each other
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.44,0:47:47.16,Song TL,,0,0,0,,Oh, starry eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.74,0:47:54.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.74,0:47:57.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.74,0:48:00.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.74,0:48:03.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.74,0:48:06.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:38.71,0:00:39.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:40.92,0:00:42.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that the holy planet?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:35.72,0:03:37.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Kahm.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.51,0:03:39.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:40.35,0:03:41.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,K... Kahm?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:43.27,0:03:44.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You understand my language?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:45.18,0:03:46.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We just kissed, didn't we?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:47.44,0:03:50.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you're able to speak our language.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:18.59,0:04:21.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see you've awoken, my dear guest
Dialogue: 99,0:04:22.14,0:04:23.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Guest?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:25.02,0:04:25.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:28.85,0:04:29.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm in space!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:30.02,0:04:31.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:36.82,0:04:39.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get it.\NThat girl must've kidnapped me.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:40.11,0:04:44.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kidnapped? Well, that's absurd!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:44.95,0:04:49.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The princess seems to\Nhave taken a liking to you!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:49.50,0:04:50.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Princess?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:50.92,0:04:52.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:52.17,0:04:55.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Princess Kahm of Saint Evascuraze.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:56.38,0:04:59.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Saint Evascuraze?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:59.51,0:05:00.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Princess Kahm?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:06.97,0:05:08.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:08.85,0:05:12.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shit! Maybe she is a princess or whatever..
Dialogue: 99,0:05:12.44,0:05:15.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but what are you going to do with me?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:20.57,0:05:24.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There. I've prepared a special\Nmeal for you, my dear guest.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:25.70,0:05:27.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is my wife Momo.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:27.54,0:05:30.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no one that can prepare a meal
Dialogue: 99,0:05:30.33,0:05:33.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,aimed at improving virility better than Momo.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:34.58,0:05:35.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, Momo?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:37.67,0:05:39.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh stop it, you!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:41.17,0:05:42.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, eat up!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:46.14,0:05:48.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Did you say, "Eat up?"
Dialogue: 99,0:05:49.93,0:05:53.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I said you'll eat later!\NSuch shameless children!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:55.40,0:05:59.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I must go and assist the\Nprincess with her wardrobe.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:00.03,0:06:01.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the first night
Dialogue: 99,0:06:01.36,0:06:05.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I must teach you the customs\Nof Saint Evascuraze.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:06.07,0:06:07.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,F-First night?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:08.03,0:06:09.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is she going to get married?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:15.71,0:06:18.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're so funny!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:18.21,0:06:21.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The groom pretending not to know!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:21.72,0:06:23.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,G-Groom?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:37.86,0:06:42.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And he has quite a large member,\NYour Highness.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:42.61,0:06:45.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, important things to keep in mind...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:46.87,0:06:50.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A wife must never embarrass her husband!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:50.49,0:06:52.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you must always back your man!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:53.58,0:06:55.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Backing your man, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:55.83,0:06:58.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's quite a technique.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:58.84,0:07:00.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what Battia said.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:00.42,0:07:04.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you must provide\Npeace of mind to your man!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:05.59,0:07:06.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right. I see. I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:08.14,0:07:09.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:09.30,0:07:12.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's only what you want\Nhim to believe, my princess.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:14.98,0:07:18.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A woman has to play her part properly.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:18.61,0:07:22.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Men are so easy to fool with just a smile.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:22.32,0:07:25.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'll sit still and try not to move.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:25.32,0:07:29.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And they'll eat all the food we feed them.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:29.74,0:07:31.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And they'll keep wanting to make babies.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:32.45,0:07:36.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, men are such pathetic creatures.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:39.04,0:07:42.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It all seems kind of complicated.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:42.46,0:07:45.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, as for tonight.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:45.92,0:07:50.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have to admit that\NI'm a little worried.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:54.35,0:07:55.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:55.27,0:07:58.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you to knock when\Nyou enter the princess' quarters?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:59.98,0:08:01.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:02.19,0:08:03.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's the matter?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:14.79,0:08:16.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're demanding that we go back to Earth?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:17.04,0:08:19.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you an idiot?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:19.96,0:08:23.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-How dare you call me\Nstupid, you invader!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:24.55,0:08:26.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-Invader?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:27.22,0:08:28.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a bit much!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:29.13,0:08:32.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the invaders that took\Nthe holy planet in the first place!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:33.10,0:08:34.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:36.85,0:08:39.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care.\NJust take me back to Earth!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:39.27,0:08:40.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or else...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:40.69,0:08:42.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or else, what?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:43.86,0:08:45.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just get away from me!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:45.82,0:08:47.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just take me back to Earth!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:50.36,0:08:51.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Honey!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:53.70,0:08:56.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You ignorant fool!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:59.21,0:09:00.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:02.88,0:09:05.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness you're okay!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:11.93,0:09:15.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shit, I don't know what kind of trick that was.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:26.98,0:09:27.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:28.23,0:09:29.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:30.49,0:09:32.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't like me...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:33.36,0:09:34.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...that's fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:34.16,0:09:37.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, that's not really it
Dialogue: 99,0:09:38.50,0:09:40.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My princess...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:41.75,0:09:45.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To think that you're doing this
Dialogue: 99,0:09:45.25,0:09:47.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,because you want to save
Dialogue: 99,0:09:47.38,0:09:48.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the people of the holy planet
Dialogue: 99,0:09:48.92,0:09:51.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The holy planet?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:51.42,0:09:54.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about Earth?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:54.80,0:09:55.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:55.93,0:10:00.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The emperor seems to want to\Ncleanse that planet of humans.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:00.52,0:10:04.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But once the princess is\Njoined to you in matrimony,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:04.10,0:10:08.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that will be enough to\Nchange the emperor's mind.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:08.73,0:10:09.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:20.45,0:10:21.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's your fault!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:21.70,0:10:22.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:27.96,0:10:28.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:35.84,0:10:37.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Battia!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:39.10,0:10:40.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When did you get here?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:40.47,0:10:42.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Long time, no see.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:42.14,0:10:44.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "long time, no see?"
Dialogue: 99,0:10:44.81,0:10:48.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been looking for you all this time.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:48.36,0:10:51.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I figured you got hooked\Non some loser of a man.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:52.90,0:10:55.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're one to talk!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:58.20,0:11:00.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's Battia, her best friend
Dialogue: 99,0:11:01.16,0:11:04.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Kahm,\NI don't know about this monkey.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:06.71,0:11:07.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Monkey?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:08.00,0:11:09.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think the emperor's going to approve?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:10.92,0:11:13.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He doesn't really understand\Nwhat you're doing.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:13.80,0:11:16.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He even asked me to go look for you.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:17.22,0:11:20.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have time to be\Nmessing with monkeys.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:20.39,0:11:23.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no hurry.\NI'll take my time.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:23.52,0:11:25.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen Dad in three months, after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:26.06,0:11:28.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of parental relationship is that?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:30.52,0:11:31.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Think you can get away from him?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:32.11,0:11:34.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the emperor's only daughter!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:34.40,0:11:38.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The one you marry is going to\Nproduce the heir to Saint Evascuraze.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:40.62,0:11:42.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just have to marry, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:44.37,0:11:46.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're thinking of him?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:47.87,0:11:49.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's a total loser!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:49.75,0:11:51.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He looks slow.\NAnd he's short.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:51.88,0:11:53.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And he looks like some pervert.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:53.71,0:11:56.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you see in that monkey, anyway?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:56.84,0:11:59.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just leave me alone!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:59.34,0:12:01.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The one Dad picked is a total jerk!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:01.80,0:12:03.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You see...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:03.10,0:12:05.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be stuck with a guy like that!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:05.89,0:12:09.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Having someone else pick\Nwho I'm going to marry...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:09.69,0:12:10.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate that!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:11.44,0:12:12.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,K-Kahm...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:19.78,0:12:24.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A knight like me... is not\Nabout to be fooled so easily.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:29.08,0:12:30.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The duties of a wife!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:30.96,0:12:32.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Momo, what were they again?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:32.92,0:12:33.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:33.88,0:12:36.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must always back your man.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:36.38,0:12:38.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it.\NI'm backing my man.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:39.22,0:12:40.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you're not going to stop me.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:43.55,0:12:44.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:44.72,0:12:47.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why can't you just find a better man?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:47.85,0:12:51.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!\NWhat do you know about men?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:53.15,0:12:54.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You little virgin.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:54.77,0:12:57.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're like a virgin!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:02.49,0:13:03.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, please!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:03.57,0:13:06.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish you two would stop!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:26.68,0:13:28.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good gosh!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:28.73,0:13:29.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:33.90,0:13:37.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kahm's fighting for me?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:38.15,0:13:39.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:10.60,0:14:14.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You fool. You think I was\Nreally going to hurt Kahm?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:15.86,0:14:19.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We were just up to our old tricks.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:19.53,0:14:20.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:23.24,0:14:27.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kahm, I suppose you fell for him\Nat first sight, like a typical virgin.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:27.83,0:14:30.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:30.62,0:14:33.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, how about a drink to celebrate?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:34.04,0:14:34.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:34.92,0:14:37.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure the emperor's going to blow!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:37.92,0:14:39.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's going to be so pissed about this.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:39.96,0:14:43.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What can he say if we do the deed first?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:46.72,0:14:49.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, we'll see what happens.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:51.06,0:14:53.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll cross that bridge when we come to it.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:53.89,0:14:55.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, um, Kahm?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:55.44,0:14:57.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe you haven't thought this out.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:57.69,0:15:01.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, you think an Earthling\Nand an Evascurazen can do it?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:01.73,0:15:02.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like, you know...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:12.41,0:15:13.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think it'll work!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:15.54,0:15:16.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:21.50,0:15:23.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's that?\NWhat the hell is that?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:23.55,0:15:26.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.\NIt's just a proximity warning.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:26.38,0:15:28.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It means someone's approaching us.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:32.43,0:15:34.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think you should be worried, Kahm.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:34.89,0:15:38.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your favorite old man is about to show up.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:38.40,0:15:39.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:46.86,0:15:48.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a drag!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:48.91,0:15:50.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's old man Progress.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:53.45,0:15:55.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The emperor has reached\Nthe height of his power.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:55.87,0:15:57.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But he has no heir.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:57.50,0:16:00.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Moreover, he is distressed\Nabout his wild, little daughter.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:01.09,0:16:03.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I can bring Kahm back,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.59,0:16:06.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,my standing in court will improve.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:10.60,0:16:13.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is going on, Your Highness?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:13.81,0:16:16.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First you hide among our fleet
Dialogue: 99,0:16:16.10,0:16:18.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and then you land on the holy planet.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:18.10,0:16:19.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Moreover, this thing...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:20.06,0:16:21.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's a monkey...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:21.98,0:16:23.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fleet Commander Progress.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:23.73,0:16:24.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop that.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:26.36,0:16:29.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I'll have to take the\Nbrunt of the emperor's fury.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:29.82,0:16:30.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:31.24,0:16:34.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's too bad.\NBut it is your job.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:34.99,0:16:36.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And also...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:36.79,0:16:39.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You seem to be plotting\Nsomething of your own.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:47.51,0:16:50.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, we have all the data you gathered,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:50.76,0:16:53.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so we must return to\Nthe empire immediately.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:24.00,0:17:26.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oops! Sorry about that!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:26.42,0:17:29.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I gave it too much power\Nand my ship went crazy.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:30.17,0:17:31.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Geobaldi?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:32.22,0:17:35.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your ship went crazy, Geobaldi?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:35.14,0:17:38.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that the kind of attitude a\Ncommander should have?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:38.39,0:17:40.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, my ship's not like yours,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:40.52,0:17:44.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,which just does patrols around the emperor.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:44.65,0:17:48.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mine's got to have a lot\Nmore spunk and spirit.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:49.11,0:17:51.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:51.20,0:17:55.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're an upstart from the colonies\Nwho can't even control his ship!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:56.45,0:17:59.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'd better watch what you say, Progress.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:00.25,0:18:03.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even the emperor doesn't\Nsee what goes on out here.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:03.46,0:18:06.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you were seen dead, floating in space,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:06.42,0:18:08.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,he'd never know who did it.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:11.01,0:18:12.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:12.13,0:18:14.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All the beautiful women,\NPrincess Kahm included,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:15.01,0:18:17.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are Geobaldi's allies.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:18.06,0:18:19.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Idiot.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:20.22,0:18:23.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Geobaldi.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:23.60,0:18:25.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get off of us!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:26.48,0:18:30.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Battia, only when you get on top of me.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:31.94,0:18:32.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cheeky.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:44.37,0:18:47.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen to me now?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:53.34,0:18:56.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you already done?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:57.76,0:18:59.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's it for me.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:59.43,0:19:01.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:01.06,0:19:04.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were going on about how\Nready you were a minute ago.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:05.56,0:19:06.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:14.24,0:19:17.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When was the first time we did it?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:17.95,0:19:19.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:19.16,0:19:21.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Getting emotional about\Nthis doesn't suit you.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:21.29,0:19:24.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been about six months\Nsince we last slept together.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:24.83,0:19:26.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:27.38,0:19:28.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just that...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:29.13,0:19:35.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never really felt what\NKahm is feeling now.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:35.34,0:19:36.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:38.14,0:19:39.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:39.35,0:19:40.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't this all your fault?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:40.68,0:19:42.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Battia...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:42.56,0:19:46.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I forgot to tell you,\NProgress is under the bed.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:46.98,0:19:47.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:57.11,0:19:58.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:58.91,0:20:01.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got lots of time
Dialogue: 99,0:20:01.58,0:20:05.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,until we get to\NSaint Evascuraze, Geobaldi.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:05.75,0:20:07.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey... Battia!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:13.80,0:20:17.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, let me leave you two together.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:21.22,0:20:23.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave them alone!\NLeave them alone!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:30.86,0:20:34.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, what's on your mind right now?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:34.53,0:20:36.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:37.19,0:20:39.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't exactly say that there's nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:42.24,0:20:46.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I think about how the fate\Nof Earth rests on my shoulders...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:50.54,0:20:53.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No! That doesn't mean\NI'm not interested in you.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:54.34,0:20:55.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just that...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:16.44,0:21:19.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you hurt me,\NI'll hate you forever.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:44.01,0:21:45.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:45.10,0:21:46.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that how they do it?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:48.77,0:21:50.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave them alone!\NLeave them alone!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:05.95,0:22:07.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way!\NThe warp's over?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:07.99,0:22:10.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the...\NBut I haven't done anything!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:49.64,0:23:51.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on. Introduce yourself
Dialogue: 99,0:23:51.85,0:23:54.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,U-Uh, um, Your Majesty..
Dialogue: 99,0:23:55.10,0:23:58.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Tetsuya Wakatsuki
Dialogue: 99,0:23:58.27,0:23:59.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,19 years old.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:59.40,0:24:01.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a photographer.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:01.57,0:24:02.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still a virgin.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:03.28,0:24:04.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, Dad!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:04.90,0:24:07.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't attack the people\Nwho live on the holy planet!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:13.37,0:24:14.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsuya's...
Dialogue: 99,0:24:16.29,0:24:18.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsuya's my fiancé!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:22.80,0:24:25.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So please don't go after Tetsuya's planet.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:42.23,0:24:45.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Who are you guys?\NLet go! Let me go!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:45.94,0:24:47.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,L-Let go!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:47.99,0:24:49.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Execute him!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:50.78,0:24:51.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Execute?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:51.91,0:24:54.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,L-Let go, you asshole!\NHey, wait!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:54.70,0:24:55.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:55.91,0:24:57.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two!\NLet go of him!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:58.16,0:24:59.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm ordering you!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:59.96,0:25:00.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:04.96,0:25:06.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:07.42,0:25:09.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kahm! This isn't what\Nyou said would happen!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:09.51,0:25:11.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How dare you lie to me!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:11.34,0:25:14.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shit! Just once!\NLet me have her once before I die!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:15.51,0:25:17.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die a virgin!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:18.85,0:25:22.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are the crown princess\Nof Saint Evascuraze.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:22.69,0:25:24.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't do it!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:26.90,0:25:30.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to do as you\Nsay forever, you know!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:31.36,0:25:32.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're being selfish!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:33.37,0:25:34.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's being selfish?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:35.16,0:25:37.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want everything to go your way.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:37.66,0:25:39.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd say you're a lot more selfish!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:40.75,0:25:43.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!\NI will choose whom you marry!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:43.63,0:25:46.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! No! No! No!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:46.67,0:25:49.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to choose myself!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:49.59,0:25:51.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nobody's going to tell me what to do!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:52.38,0:25:53.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:53.59,0:25:55.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apologize to His Majesty.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:56.31,0:25:57.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:57.51,0:26:00.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're just having a bad nightmare.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:00.23,0:26:04.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you're just imagining getting\Nmarried to that lowly creature.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:04.81,0:26:05.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look...
Dialogue: 99,0:26:06.52,0:26:10.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know everything about\Nwhat you're plotting.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:10.74,0:26:12.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't want me to tell Dad...
Dialogue: 99,0:26:13.53,0:26:14.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...get out of the way!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:17.74,0:26:18.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:39.43,0:26:41.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tet... su... ya...
Dialogue: 99,0:27:10.25,0:27:11.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get up here!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:14.72,0:27:15.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 99,0:27:15.80,0:27:16.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, hurry!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:18.51,0:27:19.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:22.85,0:27:24.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:37.24,0:27:39.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:39.78,0:27:40.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:44.83,0:27:45.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:55.84,0:27:58.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsuya, you're still alive!
Dialogue: 99,0:28:06.52,0:28:07.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:08.02,0:28:09.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a little dizzy.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:09.77,0:28:11.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you some kind of pervert?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:13.11,0:28:14.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm just a normal guy!
Dialogue: 99,0:28:20.28,0:28:22.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsuya! Thank you!
Dialogue: 99,0:28:29.21,0:28:32.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to have to teach my dad a lesson!
Dialogue: 99,0:28:52.90,0:28:53.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:55.03,0:28:55.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:57.49,0:28:58.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's elope.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:00.11,0:29:01.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elope?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:03.03,0:29:07.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So we can consummate our forbidden love!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:09.37,0:29:12.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's enough fun and games.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:12.75,0:29:14.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up.\NCome on.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:14.92,0:29:16.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're in trouble.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:16.67,0:29:21.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you,\Nnow I'm a wanted man.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:23.14,0:29:23.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:23.93,0:29:25.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want to join us?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:25.85,0:29:29.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're with us, the empire\Ncan't get at you so easily.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:29.77,0:29:31.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That sounds fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:32.77,0:29:35.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But all for this lowlife!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:39.57,0:29:40.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your Highness,
Dialogue: 99,0:29:40.90,0:29:42.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what's happened to you?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:42.45,0:29:44.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enough of your weird interests.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:44.95,0:29:45.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:46.95,0:29:50.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I might just be a lowly creature!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:54.08,0:29:57.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I'm not going to let you insult Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:00.59,0:30:03.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, this is interesting.\NCome at me!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:18.90,0:30:20.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want to try again?
Dialogue: 99,0:30:20.40,0:30:23.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is man to man!\NDie!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:26.41,0:30:29.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not much, considering your big mouth.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:30.91,0:30:31.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsuya!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:31.91,0:30:33.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay back, Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:33.29,0:30:34.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Women should stay out of this!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:34.96,0:30:37.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a duel, man to man!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:39.50,0:30:40.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsuya...
Dialogue: 99,0:30:41.05,0:30:43.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you still going to shoot off your mouth?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:48.24,0:31:49.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Accept your defeat.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:54.62,0:31:55.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:57.37,0:31:59.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you really want to die?
Dialogue: 99,0:32:00.04,0:32:01.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:42.13,0:32:44.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tetsuya!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:45.80,0:32:47.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's still breathing.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:48.22,0:32:49.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Use that special power, Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:51.05,0:32:53.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never tried this\Nresuscitation technique before,
Dialogue: 99,0:32:53.14,0:32:56.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but only those of royal blood can do it.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:03.15,0:33:06.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Emergency alert!\NThe alien has escaped!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:06.82,0:33:09.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He appears to have\Nkidnapped Princess Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:09.78,0:33:13.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All palace forces are on emergency status!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:28.80,0:33:30.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll hold back the troops.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:41.31,0:33:44.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's have some fun while we stall them.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:44.31,0:33:45.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go crazy.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:12.68,0:34:14.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you die.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:21.73,0:34:23.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you die!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:43.29,0:34:44.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow...
Dialogue: 99,0:34:50.55,0:34:52.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My injuries!\NMy injuries are gone!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:08.73,0:35:10.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kahm.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:17.37,0:35:18.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Kahm?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:20.95,0:35:22.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm just tired.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:25.12,0:35:27.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'm not drunk!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:29.63,0:35:32.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just hang on to me tight, and you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:35.30,0:35:38.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, I didn't tell you to grab me there!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:41.22,0:35:42.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn!\NThey're after us!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:49.73,0:35:50.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:51.48,0:35:53.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come here, Your Highness!\NI'll save you!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:54.82,0:35:55.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:07.92,0:36:09.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The dock is just past this.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:11.38,0:36:12.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piece of cake.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:28.65,0:36:29.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:30.23,0:36:31.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You all right?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:31.44,0:36:32.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:39.45,0:36:39.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 99,0:36:42.70,0:36:43.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Activate engines!
Dialogue: 99,0:36:52.59,0:36:54.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:13.44,0:37:14.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What shall we do?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:22.95,0:37:23.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your orders!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:28.37,0:37:30.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Battia and Geobaldi!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:31.25,0:37:32.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No need to thank us.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:32.88,0:37:34.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here comes your favorite guy.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:41.05,0:37:43.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!\NIs that Progress?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:44.18,0:37:45.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I bet he's mad as hell
Dialogue: 99,0:37:46.47,0:37:47.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready to attack!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:48.43,0:37:50.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The target is very close to us.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:50.52,0:37:52.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we fire with too much power,
Dialogue: 99,0:37:52.31,0:37:54.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Princess Kahm's vessel will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:55.69,0:37:57.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.\NAim for the engines.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:57.40,0:37:59.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make it so she can't move.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:59.44,0:38:00.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:07.37,0:38:08.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about our counterattack?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:08.91,0:38:10.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Too early.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:17.00,0:38:18.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To all vessels:
Dialogue: 99,0:38:19.13,0:38:22.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Surround both Kahm\Nand Geobaldi's vessels!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:32.31,0:38:33.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yikes.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:33.39,0:38:34.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't we just warp out of here?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:35.23,0:38:35.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:35.94,0:38:37.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're still in planetary gravitational space.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:37.82,0:38:39.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We haven't even done the repairs\Nto the damaged spots yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:40.11,0:38:41.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'd be lucky if we could power up!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:41.61,0:38:42.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:43.07,0:38:44.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take it easy!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:44.91,0:38:46.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are we set to go?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:46.41,0:38:48.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all ready to go.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:49.45,0:38:50.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:52.66,0:38:54.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about that?\NYou can't move.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:01.97,0:39:02.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a fleet!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:07.51,0:39:09.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!\NTurn around!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:10.64,0:39:13.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Head straight for Progress' ship!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:23.90,0:39:26.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The fool.\NWhat's Geobaldi doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:26.41,0:39:27.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's leaving himself open.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:28.12,0:39:30.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Full power to the main gun!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:31.16,0:39:32.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's totally reckless!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:38.17,0:39:40.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?\NAre you crazy?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:42.55,0:39:43.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Kahm!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:43.84,0:39:44.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, lowlife...
Dialogue: 99,0:39:46.09,0:39:47.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take care of the princess.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:48.05,0:39:48.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Geobaldi.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:51.18,0:39:52.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Target in sight!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:53.14,0:39:55.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the end of Geobaldi.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:16.25,0:40:17.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:22.75,0:40:23.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:25.26,0:40:27.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The ship is shedding its armor!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:27.68,0:40:28.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:45.07,0:40:46.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 99,0:40:51.45,0:40:54.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The entire fleet is shedding its skin!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:57.50,0:40:58.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:59.58,0:41:01.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We did it, Captain!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:02.29,0:41:02.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:03.09,0:41:05.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did Geobaldi do this?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:15.56,0:41:16.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sights are okay!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:17.39,0:41:18.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:49.76,0:41:53.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose all of that was pointless.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:54.01,0:41:57.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The princess' ship is escaping\Nwith Geobaldi's ship.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:57.97,0:42:01.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you not going to pursue\Nthem and get the princess back?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:01.52,0:42:02.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your orders?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:02.44,0:42:03.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just leave them.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:57.91,0:42:59.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave them alone!\NLeave them alone!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:02.83,0:43:03.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave them alone!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:07.17,0:43:07.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gently.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:07.92,0:43:10.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like we'll be able to save Earth.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:16.72,0:43:20.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A man, so what?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:22.77,0:43:25.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you seem pissed off today.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:25.23,0:43:27.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and drink this!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:29.07,0:43:30.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're out of hand.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:30.69,0:43:32.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Out of hand?\NProblem with that?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:34.28,0:43:36.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's kind of sexy.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:48.79,0:43:50.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A kiss is so sweet.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:51.71,0:43:52.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you think?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:52.84,0:43:53.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take it easy!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:54.63,0:43:56.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave them alone!\NLeave them alone!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:06.73,0:44:12.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nemuru yoru no sora ni\NIn the sleepy night sky
Dialogue: 99,0:44:13.40,0:44:20.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hoshi ga egaku HOROSCOPE wa\NThe horoscope of stars
Dialogue: 99,0:44:21.95,0:44:32.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Futari no ai o musubu aoi densetsu\NReveals a blue legend of lovers joining together
Dialogue: 99,0:44:50.73,0:44:56.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aa an at a to mitsumeatta toki kara\NAh, when I first laid eyes on you
Dialogue: 99,0:44:57.82,0:45:02.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mienai ito kanjita\NI felt something special
Dialogue: 99,0:45:03.58,0:45:09.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aa watashi no kokoro hikiyoseru no wa\NAh, the one who draws my soul
Dialogue: 99,0:45:10.71,0:45:14.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,DÉJÀ VU no hohoemi\NThe déjà vu of your smile
Dialogue: 99,0:45:16.71,0:45:19.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold me daite\NPlease hold me
Dialogue: 99,0:45:20.05,0:45:23.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kiss you amaku\NKiss you sweetly
Dialogue: 99,0:45:23.18,0:45:26.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Love me towa ni\NLove me forever
Dialogue: 99,0:45:26.18,0:45:32.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tonight, tonight, tonight!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:32.48,0:45:35.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Starry eyes, holy eyes
Dialogue: 99,0:45:35.90,0:45:45.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hitomi no naka ni aoi hoshi o atsumenagara\NAs we stare, we gaze at the blue planet
Dialogue: 99,0:45:45.41,0:45:48.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Starry eyes, holy eyes
Dialogue: 99,0:45:48.70,0:45:51.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kienai hikari\NAn unseen light
Dialogue: 99,0:45:51.79,0:45:57.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai o ai o shinjiatta\NWe believe in the love
Dialogue: 99,0:45:57.59,0:46:04.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, starry eyes
Dialogue: 99,0:46:33.79,0:46:39.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aa kore kara donna toki ga kuru no ka\NAh, whatever we may face in the future
Dialogue: 99,0:46:40.63,0:46:44.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dare mo shiranai keredo\NNo one knows
Dialogue: 99,0:46:46.47,0:46:52.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aa sore demo to oi sora no mukou ni\NAh, but still I'm sure there is something
Dialogue: 99,0:46:53.39,0:46:58.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nanika ga aru hazu\NFar in the distant sky
Dialogue: 99,0:46:59.65,0:47:02.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold me daite\NPlease hold me
Dialogue: 99,0:47:02.65,0:47:05.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kiss you amaku\NKiss you sweetly
Dialogue: 99,0:47:06.03,0:47:08.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Love me towa ni\NLove me forever
Dialogue: 99,0:47:08.83,0:47:15.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tonight, tonight, tonight!
Dialogue: 99,0:47:15.33,0:47:18.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Starry eyes, holy eyes
Dialogue: 99,0:47:18.38,0:47:21.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hitomi no naka de\NAs we stare
Dialogue: 99,0:47:21.80,0:47:27.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Negai kanau you ni ryuusei\NWe hope our wishes will come true
Dialogue: 99,0:47:28.39,0:47:31.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Starry eyes, holy eyes
Dialogue: 99,0:47:31.43,0:47:34.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yokogiru sora ni\NCrossing the sky
Dialogue: 99,0:47:34.64,0:47:40.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai o ai o chikaiatta\NWe declare our love for each other
Dialogue: 99,0:47:40.44,0:47:47.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, starry eyes
Dialogue: 99,0:47:49.37,0:47:51.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave them alone!\NLeave them alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.74,0:48:09.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
